    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/dentistry-hospital/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Dentistry Hospital theme is a clean and modern website solution designed for healthcare-related services, including dental clinics and other medical clinics. It provides a structured layout suitable for presenting dental treatments, doctor profiles, clinic facilities, patient testimonials, and general healthcare information in a clear and organized manner. The theme can also be used by dental surgeons and orthodontists who want to display their services and professional details online. It includes a responsive design that adapts to desktops, tablets, and smartphones, ensuring consistent access across devices. With built-in customization options, users can modify colors, fonts, images, and homepage sections without requiring coding knowledge. The theme supports integration with Contact Form 7 for handling inquiries and is compatible with appointment booking plugins for managing patient visits. It also includes blog functionality, allowing oral care centers to publish updates, dental care tips, and informational content. Developed with clean code and an SEO-friendly structure, it helps improve site visibility and usability. This theme is suitable for small practices, healthcare providers, and dental clinics looking for a simple and functional website setup."
    },
